---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Register | OncoRay"
	description="Create an OncoRay account to begin uploading X-rays and reviewing AI-assisted cancer screening flags."
>
	<div class="page-shell">
		<div class="frame register-layout">
			<section class="register-card glass-card animate-rise">
				<div class="card-header">
					<p class="section-label">Create account</p>
					<h1>Open a secure lane for incoming X-ray studies.</h1>
					<p>
						Set up your workspace in seconds. We keep the flow minimal here: just email and
						password, then you're ready to upload scans and review model output.
					</p>
				</div>

				<form class="register-form">
					<label>
						<span>Email</span>
						<input type="email" placeholder="oncology.ops@clinic.org" />
					</label>

					<label>
						<span>Password</span>
						<input type="password" placeholder="Create a strong password" />
					</label>

					<button type="submit">Create workspace account</button>
				</form>

				<div class="footnote">
					<span>Already onboarded?</span>
					<a href="/login">Log in instead</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="register-copy animate-rise delay-2">
				<span class="eyebrow">Rapid onboarding</span>
				<h2 class="headline">A calmer front door for a high-stakes workflow.</h2>
				<p class="lede">
					OncoRay is designed for fast triage and careful communication. The interface surfaces
					suspicious regions, confidence signals, and review checkpoints without pretending the
					model replaces clinical judgment.
				</p>

				<div class="feature-grid">
					<div>
						<strong>Image-first pipeline</strong>
						<span>Upload chest X-rays and keep series aligned automatically.</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>Risk visualization</strong>
						<span>Highlight suspicious areas and route them for expert confirmation.</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>Audit-friendly flow</strong>
						<span>Every screening note is structured for follow-up and escalation.</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.register-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(360px, 470px) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: 30px;
		align-items: center;
		min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
	}

	.register-card {
		padding: 30px;
		border-radius: 34px;
	}

	.card-header h1,
	.feature-grid strong {
		font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
	}

	.card-header h1 {
		margin: 10px 0 14px;
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
		line-height: 0.95;
		letter-spacing: -0.06em;
	}

	.card-header p:last-child {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.register-form {
		display: grid;
		gap: 18px;
		margin-top: 28px;
	}

	label span {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	input {
		width: 100%;
		padding: 16px 18px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 20px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
		color: var(--text);
		outline: none;
		transition:
			border-color 180ms ease,
			transform 180ms ease,
			background 180ms ease;
	}

	input:focus {
		border-color: rgba(255, 132, 104, 0.72);
		background: rgba(255, 132, 104, 0.06);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	button {
		padding: 16px 18px;
		border: 0;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-warm) 0%, #ffd3c9 100%);
		color: #1f0d08;
		font-weight: 800;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.footnote {
		display: flex;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 20px;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.footnote a {
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.feature-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 16px;
		margin-top: 34px;
	}

	.feature-grid div {
		padding: 20px;
		border-radius: 24px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
	}

	.feature-grid span {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 8px;
		color: var(--muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 980px) {
		.register-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.feature-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.register-card {
			padding: 22px 18px;
		}
	}
</style>
